== A final note

This document was written in vswrite, with AI assistance for the
parts AI is good at — paragraph tightening, citation lookups,
table formatting — and without it for the parts where the writer's
judgement is what makes the text useful. We hope it gives you a
honest sense of both what the tool can do and what we think it
should not be asked to do.

Now, take a copy of this project and start writing yours.
